        <rdfs:comment>Note that this term is intended to annotate gene products that are not attached to the cell surface. For gene products from multicellular organisms which are secreted from a cell but retained within the organism (i.e. released into the interstitial fluid or blood), consider the cellular component term &apos;extracellular space ; GO:0005615&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>extracellular region</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


