        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000306"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>This type of memory, lasting hours to months, critically depends on a transfer of the information from short term memory using repeated rehearsal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
