        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>This type of memory, lasting hours to months, critically depends on a transfer of the information from short term memory using repeated rehearsal.</owl:annotatedTarget>
