        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000200"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of priming where the target is a word that has a high probability of appearing with the prime, and is \&quot;associated\&quot; with it but not necessarily related in semantic features.</obo:IAO_0000115>
