        <obo:IAO_0000115>A REM parasomnia consisting of breath holding and expiratory groaning during sleep that is distinct from both somniloquy and obstructive sleep apnea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:date>2011-04-09T10:13:44Z</dc:date>
