        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>colonic</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In mammals, the colon consists of four sections: the ascending colon, the transverse colon, the descending colon, and the sigmoid colon[WP]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>In zebrafish, the posterior intestine has short longitudinally arranged epithelial folds which are similar to the colon of higher vertebrates[ZFIN]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>it extracts water and salt from solid wastes before they are eliminated from the body[WP]</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
        <rdfs:label>colon</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


