            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>we follow the FMA and treat the artery as a tree-structure - here we include the internal and external as parts. For the part that excludes the branches, see &apos;trunk of common carotid artery&apos;</obo:IAO_0000116>
