        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>provides some protection from trauma and damage.</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>The renal capsule relates to the other layers in the following order (moving from innermost to outermost): renal medulla renal cortex renal capsule perinephric fat (or &apos;perirenal fat&apos;) renal fascia paranephric fat (or &apos;pararenal fat&apos;) peritoneum (anteriorly), and transversalis fascia (posteriorly).[Wikipedia:Kidney_capsule]</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
