            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>note that this class includes both metanephric and mesonephric vesicles - ZFA and EHDAA2 associations are placed with these classes. TODO - make a more specific develops_from relationship - see UBERON:0005107 ! metanephric cap</obo:IAO_0000116>
