            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000013>Less commonly, urogenital fold refers to the fold in the mesonephros which is the precursor of e.g. the suspensory ligament of the ovary. This is the case in older versions of Gray&apos;s anatomy[WP]</obo:UBPROP_0000013>
