            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>we represent the field as being a part of the LPM (consistent with ZFA, Gilbert). As a consequence, the relationship between limb bud (with is ectoderm+mesenchyme) stands in a weaker has_developmental_contribution_from relation to the field - TODO implement this.</obo:IAO_0000116>
